{"title":"Career Roadmap — Interaction Developer","role":"Interaction Developer","summary":"An Interaction Developer combines software engineering, UI/UX principles, interaction design, front-end development, animation, and human-computer interaction to build digital experiences that are intuitive, responsive, accessible, and engaging.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Computer Science & Design (CSD)"},"about":[{"label":"Dataset ID","text":"332"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Interaction Developer combines software engineering, UI/UX principles, interaction design, front-end development, animation, and human-computer interaction to build digital experiences that are intuitive, responsive, accessible, and engaging."},{"type":"p","text":"The role sits between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Design","Front-End Engineering","Interaction Design","User Experience"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"An Interaction Developer typically converts interaction concepts, prototypes, and design systems into working digital experiences."},{"type":"h","text":"Core responsibilities"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Build interactive web and application interfaces"},{"text":"Translate UX/UI designs into functional experiences"},{"text":"Develop animations and micro-interactions"},{"text":"Implement responsive layouts"},{"text":"Create reusable UI components"},{"text":"Work with designers and UX researchers"},{"text":"Improve usability and accessibility"},{"text":"Optimize interaction performance"},{"text":"Implement gesture and touch interactions"},{"text":"Integrate APIs and application logic"},{"text":"Test interactions across devices and browsers"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus","Expected Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Interaction & Front-End Foundations"},{"text":"HTML, CSS, JavaScrip